# Strings harvest.py found in math-study that are not terminology.
#
# Kept so a rerun after a new chapter shows the handful of genuinely new
# candidates instead of re-proposing all of these. Three kinds live here:
# prose scaffolding the author writes constantly (存在, 任意, 仮定), terms
# whose mathematical sense is not distinct from their everyday one (定義,
# 計算, 対応), and segmentation artifacts — 〜全体 constructions, and
# truncations left behind by inline math (項関係 from 2項関係, 級多様体 from
# $C^{\infty}$級多様体, 単純型付 from 単純型付き). The repaired forms are in
# terms/*.tsv; the broken ones are here so they stay dead.
#
# Delete a line to reconsider it on the next run.
